#: scenario7:scenario7_090A51F1_861C_4F72_B0D5_474947B3F7E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b54757033ed6dac8308a6514228d351645d04d66fbea78f188e1a3e606c045a1
#. default-sha256: aa6d49374d7be9ca188d016f2f38cf6120c92aac35d90a893f475cf8080e84c4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_090A51F1_861C_4F72_B0D5_474947B3F7E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫...And so, my life came to an end."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫...E così, la mia vita giunse al termine."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5D8C55D5_BF96_41AE_A46B_B7820CB71569
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 045e128f1eb60326d33f777614d498e2bb2f345145a7e0c6c5008e645ddd14e8
#. default-sha256: 6d408ecad5f5acbcfaee3fd10dd30555c685e25e17e5b37e010963499f4daa1b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5D8C55D5_BF96_41AE_A46B_B7820CB71569"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But that wasn’t the end of the story."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ma non fu quella la fine della mia storia."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C51746E0_7E56_4329_86EF_EDB666693DA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40a9a37e1c598624ce1990db794b582017e9f20c594a2bf88aa4ed222b61ecc1
#. default-sha256: 7b2ca9c29388cec618e567bb3cb972abbaf231d44d5e1df1a1b2e371a62ce0c4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C51746E0_7E56_4329_86EF_EDB666693DA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t know if what comes next could be called “my” story,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫but memories of these "
"events linger in my soul."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non so se ciò che accadde dopo andrebbe chiamata la “mia” storia,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma i ricordi di "
"quegli eventi indugiano nella mia anima."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3DE6F1A1_7E45_4823_BB18_DFE93D6A6332
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a77ae021e17f1961af3eb6ea01416c7ada11516029950ba6a3aa65259259c0b
#. default-sha256: d48241da971a4b9df29c61cc433006a274c9970396c18b48260041f54356ba9e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3DE6F1A1_7E45_4823_BB18_DFE93D6A6332"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫How could I have ever imagined...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that I would be made to witness my own misery "
"even in death?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Come avrei potuto mai immaginare...⟪k:1⟫ che sarei stato costretto⟪k:2⟫ad assistere alla mia "
"stessa miseria anche nella morte?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8C20439B_C5B4_4D4A_AFAB_5CCD52C9ED90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2280967a36ebab503abf1504cadec36342e53994f4e7b02ec04f8e7d7b650125
#. default-sha256: a84b51c727b59b56f47de5e605df645e3cf2c6e661ff799a88d7e8022ba9be20
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8C20439B_C5B4_4D4A_AFAB_5CCD52C9ED90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And my soul—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫evidently still bound to my flesh—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E la mia anima—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫evidentemente ancora legata al mio corpo—"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A3D92C5D_C2DD_4CE0_8512_FCF7FE870B04
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbdf24fa9d3b656fb186c31d3d58e6c9dc29316494ddaddd25fac3e29d2cc1ae
#. default-sha256: 79706ef2e48ab17098b139279213819046c0e977533eb7c5739129e8de9f98a3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A3D92C5D_C2DD_4CE0_8512_FCF7FE870B04"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was dragged along with it, against my will, down to the nearby village."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫venne trascinata insieme ad esso, contro la mia volontà, fino al villaggio vicino."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E61D0C8B_E817_4C49_8BCD_986BDDA99580
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0cb1a41c355ea51f673a1a6b6db6bbed74b9d6c1d2187a0b5c4b448d816888ca
#. default-sha256: 795ab43ec56c417b2bb726d0088a3c1bafc48556a55d3d845caae8516c359226
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E61D0C8B_E817_4C49_8BCD_986BDDA99580"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The knights have returned from their holy quest!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I cavalieri sono tornati dalla loro sacra missione!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4BC5D94C_29C0_4512_8464_CFCAC63C2BC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa978c51712a9024315c2e55fd9af9a390b3022c1c23d09f69c9076f3bbceac8
#. default-sha256: 6a36b5ebbfb1d3e41f0a718104f14259f2fc995a043a3ba28b159f564495be3b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4BC5D94C_29C0_4512_8464_CFCAC63C2BC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, how we’ve awaited your arrival!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, quanto abbiamo atteso il vostro ritorno!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CB3ED887_927B_45F4_AD8F_4F1D0214AA0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1c6bdd00259cadf6dc316ac2d1c319c38dbfd59cae1a8c0cac8ff3ce5ca509e
#. default-sha256: ebd7aa353e05c24b02f513f317ce89cf88cabe87a93c40c8760b3613ff07e521
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CB3ED887_927B_45F4_AD8F_4F1D0214AA0F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫How glorious it is to see you!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Quanto è bello rivedervi!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1E29A1D1_0BEE_452D_97A6_C04B078CD2D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 291b94ecf33388261559d0a9fe056e2440e7e955af45f65aaa8e057e070da263
#. default-sha256: 7266e2db006b140510a8a552517e7f5160618779567f3ebe3d5c0ed8a45da392
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1E29A1D1_0BEE_452D_97A6_C04B078CD2D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Waiting for us there was a cluster of villagers.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A large cross lay on the ground in "
"the center of the square."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ad attenderci c’era un nutrito gruppo di paesani.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Una grande croce giaceva a terra "
"al centro della piazza."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A1924AEC_E6D6_462F_BDE5_51024E31F01B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74d1e33970742e591db4e800b055eb90c9d2e31f0c5352bf53e513f307923908
#. default-sha256: 7756d0563fbae2d266047d2782e33e7e1e5c8c954972f250b69e514edc2b5a7a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A1924AEC_E6D6_462F_BDE5_51024E31F01B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Holding torches, they formed a crowd around the knights, several of them familiar faces."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Reggendo delle torce, gli abitanti del villaggio—molti dei quali avevano volti familiari—"
"formarono una folla attorno ai cavalieri."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F52A9436_A594_40DB_8213_25E1D487198D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53bee8bf11f42eb71a446f0f2a942092857bf73b510c010d2b571a42b9813747
#. default-sha256: a0cb7a175e72ee96d797455052a8c2a0d1711ec6a4d48e5710f145493a3fc453
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F52A9436_A594_40DB_8213_25E1D487198D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No longer shall we live in fear of the curse befalling us!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eternal peace is assured!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non vivremo più nella paura che la maledizione possa abbattersi⟪k:1⟫su di noi!⟪k:2⟫ La pace "
"eterna è assicurata!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_16B2FCE2_C477_4BD9_8C7D_E88D8A4AF579
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 59b6e479fd4607dddcef98f8ee9f63afa114188e8ae0cd04c02ba5586c7a6bb2
#. default-sha256: e34ff7c45f4f3ef35906f4c2fc2a9589177238f7a4157d8dc9a20004c77e9236
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_16B2FCE2_C477_4BD9_8C7D_E88D8A4AF579"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why, then... ⟪k:1⟫were they acting like I was at fault?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perché allora... ⟪k:1⟫si comportavano come se fosse mia la colpa?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4CEDA84C_E7DE_4F7A_8E6C_4075FF9ED2EC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: addd0633bd2a1febe95da3b93224bb85dbfe81337aec7c627a22cb566a7f9467
#. default-sha256: 42ac32c42feb82495e46eb16b9fb3ab7951585e9201f45225674016befb390a3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4CEDA84C_E7DE_4F7A_8E6C_4075FF9ED2EC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why was I the sinner, and why did I need to be judged?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Perché ero io il peccatore?⟪k:1⟫E perché ero io colui che doveva essere giudicato?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2A266E31_4BB9_464A_9B6B_7551BF55087C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8012334ef5a3438804cc6882c4d7be6eab5a1f9c020b0b6bec4de50a0349acd2
#. default-sha256: 95d380d4eadf783377657897e7eedac374593306b754e34c6e67a34c0e3b9c2f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2A266E31_4BB9_464A_9B6B_7551BF55087C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My soul trembled at the overwhelming fervor consuming the crowd, ⟪k:1⟫their zealous desire "
"to see judgment cast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La mia anima tremava di fronte al soverchiante fervore che consumava la folla, ⟪k:1⟫e al "
"loro esaltato desiderio di veder emessa⟪k:2⟫la sentenza."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4055B4D2_8A2F_48DF_801C_6AA7C0D5ADC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1772ccbcdc80c235a2fa86b4669e9899eca36874a297ffcd4b6d6b9d20c761b5
#. default-sha256: 47f821aa6d172214e0d2b10883bec3f8ed979ae30251b95862867eb091436d44
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4055B4D2_8A2F_48DF_801C_6AA7C0D5ADC8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please don’t do this, Didier...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Please, hear my voice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Per favore, non farlo, Didier...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ti prego, ascolta la mia voce..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_90CACC1B_FB5C_4F6A_A11B_C62ACBF86CA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93c4b116be25dd1ce55e6e97dc5960bb3ad23511d6b7adfbf9876f8b8418f440
#. default-sha256: 9489d99b577a37e7d9fef0634afd9f5d0b5ab76e8a4f40704e5397c40c44645b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_90CACC1B_FB5C_4F6A_A11B_C62ACBF86CA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Please, tell me ⟪k:1⟫you⟪k:2⟫, at least, don’t think I did those things..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ti prego, dimmi che ⟪k:1⟫almeno tu⟪k:2⟫ non pensi che io abbia fatto quelle cose..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1809491C_BCB6_4470_BD73_A9E1B6453A66
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61cc080f761768d15b78e81ac7cddf39d1266247f9fbe8b37a0e944959ad2991
#. default-sha256: 9ab4680f0913ba0e2eaec5f018cc56fb143b235346ef93200f7552bf2a16f8c8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1809491C_BCB6_4470_BD73_A9E1B6453A66"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t put me on that cross...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If it was Mother who sold me out to the Church,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non mettermi su quella croce...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se è stata nostra Madre a vendermi alla Chiesa,"

#: scenario7:scenario7_748FDB2D_891F_4063_B06B_CA7A27FC96BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 665fa2cc15c5a56eee476fdf99deca72391eb120a8b5c0da7edaea3c35da1139
#. default-sha256: c4b2b3a5a7c0914e49eb391486b8d22ec5b3631f9d16273d491d131a82c4b4df
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_748FDB2D_891F_4063_B06B_CA7A27FC96BC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The nails and rope for the crucifixion are here.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We would have you, O knight, "
"deliver the Lord’s judgment unto this vile witch!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I chiodi e la corda per la crocifissione sono qui.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫O prode cavaliere, infliggi a "
"questa spregevole strega la condanna voluta da nostro Signore!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_FE7C6CF8_459E_46AF_AA1C_47F64264FA6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e761ec92b58307cb53f49c6def1221e9b298f3525f40d5c2cb6351e2054a79f2
#. default-sha256: a6fc38a7f31336ab0dfe274f49400ee31590f8ecd73f8fcd2d478a03b056f55c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FE7C6CF8_459E_46AF_AA1C_47F64264FA6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Didier..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Didier..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_83319B1E_A3C6_4451_9E94_294CD95D46DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad3f826abf496ea939a1a42b46650c9e92dc3030eca9b77995d9ad479e1d1a43
#. default-sha256: 126032a1ac4bef612454842b45aac49452918a0196f9435ee839974589b64f2b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_83319B1E_A3C6_4451_9E94_294CD95D46DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucifixion!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crocifissione!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4307D535_FE8B_4BE6_BCDC_93F1F1C3CF34
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b76ba6b62c7b8fd5ba8b5afa8ac626467665b7aae3f66b5279bded6bdc19f4d4
#. default-sha256: fdbf2df5db1dcbe0fadcb66d175468d7dde43b86641640a5dcd018cf43fa9946
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4307D535_FE8B_4BE6_BCDC_93F1F1C3CF34"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crucify it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Crocifiggetela!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE5EED1B_42A0_45A3_A6C7_15DD67C76C1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f216c62ba1aa3c4e75471c4c1cb0eaf80a692b2b3d26f890231cdbd98374c70a
#. default-sha256: 616e967bcbbc63321ec9f7dd60afaab0325f5bc0476d0374a01d79a3e19b16ff
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE5EED1B_42A0_45A3_A6C7_15DD67C76C1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My brother lowered my corpse to the ground and began removing my clothing, ⟪k:1⟫and in that "
"very moment, I realized the purpose of hanging someone from a cross."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mio fratello poggiò il mio cadavere sul terreno e iniziò a svestirmi,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e in quel "
"preciso istante, compresi lo scopo di appendere qualcuno⟪k:3⟫alla croce."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B88FDF38_E3ED_4B5C_B13B_53B336DCF166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5d736334f17cfe5d2e6e1b6c1b6a2a8de8ea96c3065bb45c95a074a1e8d369f
#. default-sha256: 33e54df4f425dbc2ddee3a5f900931bf4ff512e31b3f3cdae3ecd2d78faff1fe
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B88FDF38_E3ED_4B5C_B13B_53B336DCF166"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Overwhelmed by hopelessness, tears streamed down my face."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sopraffatto dalla disperazione, sentivo le lacrime scorrermi lungo il viso."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F330EC48_B442_43BB_867C_F9A5674ECE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4cbc3a877208f835263e123e50442a6b54887f1213a1c5091963818ca9efb86
#. default-sha256: b55896ff3275a0f5d450b1ad9d880fb915abba69e9dd199b0bd2d12e24044699
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F330EC48_B442_43BB_867C_F9A5674ECE91"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫don’t do it!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫non farlo!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BFF95DC4_C5B9_4167_A118_3B8955B2FC84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 247c412d1fec500b63cd5c35ac34a71e4cc341dd12bb686b7c286d1a609c5c4e
#. default-sha256: 23b9df6d58b88365a1083d79ab6b82c92f19a9ef0d1639b0b371dfc1ded1b0b4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BFF95DC4_C5B9_4167_A118_3B8955B2FC84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫For a brief moment, an unpleasant silence spread through the crowd. ⟪k:1⟫The erratic "
"crackling of their torches was the only sound that could be heard in the square."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Per un breve istante, uno spiacevole silenzio si diffuse tra la folla.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Il crepitio "
"irregolare delle loro torce era l’unico suono che si poteva udire nella piazza."

#: scenario7:scenario7_00E0D90C_518C_432E_A046_E7253A8B1690
