#: scenario7:scenario7_D9402C58_A190_461E_A668_9D5A1CC65766
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 414006a5c7be9e2b41336916368f64fbdb95b69fc20bda2157a84c229f33cfe1
