msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫First there was the kind, mild-mannered, flaxen-haired boy.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫a woman—"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫and he—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫a man—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫were joined in love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Prima c’è stato il mite e gentile ragazzo dai capelli dorati.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫una donna"
"—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫e lui—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫un uomo—⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫vi siete uniti nell’amore."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D8948555_52B3_4A6C_9C69_6CEE748DF8F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
