msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then there was the deranged man-beast.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫By exposing your female body to him,⟪k:3⟫"
"you were able to temporarily contain his madness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Poi c’è stato lo squilibrato uomo-bestia.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Mostrandogli il tuo corpo femminile,⟪k:3⟫"
"sei riuscito a contenere momentaneamente la sua follia."

